#: include/global_settings.php:430
msgid "Enable Gradient Support"
msgstr "Aktiveer gradiëntondersteuning"

#: include/global_settings.php:431
msgid "Enabled Gradient Support for AREA and STACK charts."
msgstr "Gradiëntondersteuning geaktiveer vir AREA- en STACK-kaarte."

#: include/global_settings.php:436
msgid "Graph Permission Method"
msgstr "Grafiektoestemmingsmetode"

#: include/global_settings.php:437
msgid "There are four methods for determining a User's Graph Permissions.  The first is 'Permissive'.  Under the 'Permissive' setting, a User only needs access to either the Graph, Device or Graph Template to gain access to the Graphs that apply to them.  Under 'Restrictive', the User must have access to the Graph, the Device, and the Graph Template to gain access to the Graph.  These first two methods have scalability problems for very large installs.  So, two additional options are available.  They are 'Device Based', which means if you have access to the Device, you get access to it's Graphs.  And lastly 'Graph Template Based', which means if you have access to the 'Graph Template' you get access to all Device Graphs of that Template."
msgstr "Daar is vier metodes om 'n Gebruiker se Grafiektoestemmings te bepaal.  Die eerste is 'Toelaatbaar'.  Onder die 'Toelaatbaar'-instelling het 'n Gebruiker slegs toegang tot óf die Grafiek, Toestel óf Grafieksjabloon nodig om toegang te kry tot die Grafieke wat op hulle van toepassing is.  Onder 'Beperkend' moet die Gebruiker toegang tot die Grafiek, die Toestel en die Grafieksjabloon hê om toegang tot die Grafiek te kry.  Hierdie eerste twee metodes het skaalbaarheidsprobleme vir baie groot installasies.  Dus is twee bykomende opsies beskikbaar.  Dit is 'Toestelgebaseer', wat beteken as jy toegang tot die Toestel het, kry jy toegang tot sy Grafieke.  En laastens 'Grafieksjabloongebaseer', wat beteken as jy toegang tot die 'Grafieksjabloon' het, kry jy toegang tot alle Toestelgrafieke van daardie Sjabloon."

#: include/global_settings.php:441
msgid "Permissive"
msgstr "Toegewend"

#: include/global_settings.php:442
msgid "Restrictive"
msgstr "Beperkend"

#: include/global_settings.php:443
msgid "Device Based"
msgstr "Toestelgebaseer"

#: include/global_settings.php:449
msgid "Graph/Data Source Creation Method"
msgstr "Grafiek-/databronskeppingsmetode"

#: include/global_settings.php:450
msgid "If set to Simple, Graphs and Data Sources can only be created from New Graphs.  If Advanced, legacy Graph and Data Source creation is supported."
msgstr "Indien op Eenvoudig gestel, kan grafieke en databronne slegs vanaf Nuwe Grafieke geskep word. Indien Gevorderd, word verouderde grafiek- en databronskepping ondersteun."

#: include/global_settings.php:453
msgid "Simple"
msgstr "Eenvoudig"

#: include/global_settings.php:454 lib/html.php:2949
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Gevorderd"

#: include/global_settings.php:458
msgid "Show Form/Setting Help Inline"
msgstr "Wys vorm-/instellinghulp inlyn"

#: include/global_settings.php:459
msgid "When checked, Form and Setting Help will be show inline.  Otherwise it will be presented when hovering over the help button."
msgstr "Wanneer gemerk, sal Vorm- en Instellinghulp inlyn gewys word.  Andersins sal dit aangebied word wanneer jy oor die hulpknoppie beweeg."

#: include/global_settings.php:464
msgid "Local Page Help Only"
msgstr "Slegs plaaslike bladsyhulp"

#: include/global_settings.php:465
msgid "By default Cacti page help is located at docs.cacti.net.  However, if your system does not have access to the Internet, you may download the documentation locally in HTML format and host it in the 'docs' location of you Cacti server.  If you choose only to leverage the local location for page help documentation, check this checkbox."
msgstr "By verstek is Cacti-bladsyhulp geleë by docs.cacti.net. As jou stelsel egter nie toegang tot die internet het nie, kan jy die dokumentasie plaaslik in HTML-formaat aflaai en dit in die 'docs'-ligging van jou Cacti-bediener aanbied. As jy kies om slegs die plaaslike ligging vir bladsyhulpdokumentasie te gebruik, merk hierdie merkblokkie."

#: include/global_settings.php:470
msgid "Deletion Verification"
msgstr "Skrapverifikasie"

#: include/global_settings.php:471
msgid "Prompt user before item deletion."
msgstr "Por gebruiker voor itemskrapping."

#: include/global_settings.php:476
msgid "Data Source Preservation Preset"
msgstr "Databron-bewaringsvoorafinstelling"

#: include/global_settings.php:477
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will set Radio Button to Delete related Data Sources of a Graph when removing Graphs.  Note: Cacti will not allow the removal of Data Sources if they are used in other Graphs."
msgstr "Wanneer geaktiveer, sal Cacti Radioknoppie stel om verwante Databronne van 'n Grafiek te Skrap wanneer Grafieke verwyder word.  Let wel: Cacti sal nie die verwydering van Databronne toelaat as dit in ander Grafieke gebruik word nie."

#: include/global_settings.php:482
msgid "Graphs Auto Unlock"
msgstr "Ontsluit grafieke outomaties"

#: include/global_settings.php:483
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will not lock Graphs.  This allow a faster manual modification of Data Sources related to a Graph."
msgstr "Wanneer geaktiveer, sal Cacti nie Grafieke sluit nie.  Dit laat 'n vinniger handmatige wysiging van Databronne verwant aan 'n Grafiek toe."

#: include/global_settings.php:488
msgid "Hide Cacti Dashboard"
msgstr "Versteek Cacti-kontroleskerm"

#: include/global_settings.php:489
msgid "For use with Cacti's External Link Support.  Using this setting, you can hide the Cacti Dashboard, so you can display just your own page."
msgstr "Vir gebruik met Cacti se eksterne skakelondersteuning. Met hierdie instelling kan jy die Cacti-kontroleskerm versteek sodat net jou eie bladsy vertoon word."

#: include/global_settings.php:494
msgid "Enable Drag-N-Drop"
msgstr "Aktiveer sleep-en-los"

#: include/global_settings.php:495
msgid "Some of Cacti's interfaces support Drag-N-Drop.  If checked this option will be enabled.  Note: For visually impaired user, this option may be disabled."
msgstr "Sommige van Cacti se koppelvlakke ondersteun Sleep-en-Los.  As dit gemerk is, sal hierdie opsie geaktiveer word.  Let wel: Vir gesiggestremde gebruikers kan hierdie opsie gedeaktiveer word."

#: include/global_settings.php:500
msgid "Site Security"
msgstr "Werfsekuriteit"

#: include/global_settings.php:505
msgid "Force Connections over HTTPS"
msgstr "Dwing verbindings oor HTTPS af"

#: include/global_settings.php:506
msgid "When checked, any attempts to access Cacti will be redirected to HTTPS to ensure high security."
msgstr "Wanneer gemerk, sal enige pogings om toegang tot Cacti te verkry na HTTPS herlei word om hoë sekuriteit te verseker."

#: include/global_settings.php:511
msgid "Allow Unsafe Remote Data Collector HTTPS"
msgstr "Laat onveilige afstanddataversamelaar-HTTPS toe"

#: include/global_settings.php:512
msgid "Allow the use of Self Signed Certificates and allow the hostname of the Certificate to differ from that of the Remote Data Collector."
msgstr "Laat die gebruik van selfondertekende sertifikate toe en laat die gasheernaam van die sertifikaat toe om te verskil van dié van die afstanddataversamelaar."

#: include/global_settings.php:517
msgid "Allow Unsafe Metacharacters in Data Input Methods"
msgstr "Laat onveilige metakarakters in data-invoermetodes toe"

#: include/global_settings.php:518
msgid "Historically, Cacti administrators created simple Data Input Methods that include commands like \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" to represent a numeric value for use in Cacti Graphs.  In earlier versions of Cacti, this was permitted.  However, this is an unsafe practice as it is a gateway for third party users to publish insecure Data Templates.  In modern Cacti, these types of practices should be avoided.  However, we provide this option if you have older Data Input Methods that contain these unsafe Meta Characters and have not converted them to local scripts in the 'scripts' directory.  When this option is unchecked, Cacti restricts shell-style metacharacters such as quotation marks, curly brackets, vertical bars, backslashes, and backticks.  Cacti continues to allow greater-than and less-than signs for things like <path_cacti> and for input parameters, but if this option is unchecked, that is the limit of their permitted use."
msgstr "Histories het Cacti-administrateurs eenvoudige datainvoermetodes geskep wat opdragte soos \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" insluit om 'n numeriese waarde vir gebruik in Cacti-grafieke voor te stel. In vroeër weergawes van Cacti is dit toegelaat. Dit is egter 'n onveilige praktyk omdat dit 'n toegangspoort vir derdepartygebruikers bied om onveilige datasjablone te publiseer. In moderne Cacti moet hierdie soort praktyke vermy word. Ons bied egter hierdie opsie as jy ouer datainvoermetodes het wat hierdie onveilige metakarakters bevat en dit nog nie na plaaslike skripte in die 'scripts'-gids omgeskakel het nie. Wanneer hierdie opsie nie gemerk is nie, beperk Cacti dopstyl-metakarakters soos aanhalingstekens, krulhakies, vertikale strepe, terugskuinsskrape en terugtiks. Cacti laat steeds groter-as- en kleiner-as-tekens toe vir dinge soos <path_cacti> en vir invoerparameters, maar as hierdie opsie nie gemerk is nie, is dit die perk van hul toegelate gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php:524
msgid "Content-Security Script Policy"
msgstr "Content-Security skripbeleid"

#: include/global_settings.php:525
msgid "Controls the script-src CSP policy.  In Nonce Modes, Cacti Plugins that use inline JavaScript must include the nonce attribute from Cacti's builtin function 'CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute()'. Otherwise, those scripts will be blocked by the browser.  Currently, Cacti only allows reporting on Cacti Plugins that do not properly use Nonce Mode.  In the future, we will allow Administrators to block such plugins from using their inline JavaScript if they are not using Nonces."
msgstr "Beheer die script-src CSP-beleid. In Nonce-modusse moet Cacti-inproppe wat inlyn-JavaScript gebruik die nonce-attribuut van Cacti se ingeboude funksie 'CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute()' insluit. Andersins sal daardie skripte deur die blaaier geblokkeer word. Tans laat Cacti slegs verslagdoening toe oor Cacti-inproppe wat nie Nonce-modus behoorlik gebruik nie. In die toekoms sal ons administrateurs toelaat om sulke inproppe te blokkeer om hul inlyn-JavaScript te gebruik as hulle nie Nonces gebruik nie."

#: include/global_settings.php:528
msgid "Allow Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "Laat nie-nonce inlyn-JavaScript toe"

#: include/global_settings.php:529
msgid "Allow both unsafe-eval and Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "Laat beide unsafe-eval en nie-nonce inlyn-JavaScript toe"

#: include/global_settings.php:530
msgid "Nonce Mode - Reporting Only"
msgstr "Nonce-modus - Slegs verslagdoening"

#: include/global_settings.php:534 include/global_settings.php:549
msgid "CSP Violation Report URI"
msgstr "CSP-oortredingsverslag-URI"

#: include/global_settings.php:535
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use <url_path>/csp_report.php. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "URL waarheen blaaiers CSP-oortredingsverslae in nonce-report- en nonce-modusse POST. Laat leeg om <url_path>/csp_report.php te gebruik. Moet slegs veilige URL-karakters bevat."

#: include/global_settings.php:541
msgid "Content-Security Alternate Sources"
msgstr "Content-Security alternatiewe bronne"

#: include/global_settings.php:542
msgid "Space delimited domain names that will be permitted to be accessed outside of the Web Server itself.  This is important for users choosing to use a CDN, or hosting site.  Sources can includes wildcards for example: *.mydomain.com, or a protocol, for example: https://*.example.com.  These Alternate Sources include Image, CSS and JavaScript types only."
msgstr "Spasie-geskeide domeinname wat toegelaat sal word om buite die Webbediener self verkry te word.  Dit is belangrik vir gebruikers wat kies om 'n CDN of gasheerwerf te gebruik.  Bronne kan jokertekens insluit, byvoorbeeld: *.mydomain.com, of 'n protokol, byvoorbeeld: https://*.example.com.  Hierdie Alternatiewe Bronne sluit slegs Beeld-, CSS- en JavaScript-tipes in."

#: include/global_settings.php:550
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use /cacti/csp_report.php at the installation root. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "URL waarheen blaaiers CSP-oortredingsverslae in nonce-report- en nonce-modusse POST. Laat leeg om /cacti/csp_report.php by die installasiewortel te gebruik. Moet slegs veilige URL-karakters bevat."

#: include/global_settings.php:562
msgid "Enable Automatic Graph Creation"
msgstr "Aktiveer outomatiese grafiekskepping"

#: include/global_settings.php:563
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Graph.  This is useful when adjusting Device settings so as to avoid creating new Graphs each time you save an object.  Invoking Automation Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Wanneer gedeaktiveer, sal Cacti-outomatisering nie aktief enige Grafiek skep nie.  Dit is nuttig wanneer Toestelinstellings aangepas word om te verhoed dat nuwe Grafieke geskep word elke keer as jy 'n objek stoor.  Die handmatige aanroep van Outomatiseringsreëls sal steeds moontlik wees."

#: include/global_settings.php:568
msgid "Enable Automatic Tree Item Creation"
msgstr "Aktiveer outomatiese boomitem-skepping"

#: include/global_settings.php:569
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Tree Item.  This is useful when adjusting Device or Graph settings so as to avoid creating new Tree Entries each time you save an object.  Invoking Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Wanneer gedeaktiveer, sal Cacti-outomatisering nie aktief enige Boomitem skep nie.  Dit is nuttig wanneer Toestel- of Grafiekinstellings aangepas word om te verhoed dat nuwe Boominskrywings geskep word elke keer as jy 'n objek stoor.  Die handmatige aanroep van Reëls sal steeds moontlik wees."

#: include/global_settings.php:573
msgid "Automation Notification To Email"
msgstr "Outomatiseringskennisgewing aan e-pos"

#: include/global_settings.php:574
msgid "The Email Address to send Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the Primary Cacti Admins Email account."
msgstr "Die E-posadres om Outomatisering-kennisgewing-e-posse na te stuur as dit nie op die Outomatiseringsnetwerk-vlak gespesifiseer is nie.  As óf hierdie veld, óf die Outomatiseringsnetwerk-waarde leeg gelaat word, sal Cacti die Primêre Cacti-admin se E-posrekening gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php:580
msgid "Automation Notification From Name"
msgstr "Outomatiseringskennisgewing vanaf naam"

#: include/global_settings.php:581
msgid "The Email Name to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Name."
msgstr "Die E-posnaam om vir Outomatisering-kennisgewing-e-posse te gebruik as dit nie op die Outomatiseringsnetwerk-vlak gespesifiseer is nie.  As óf hierdie veld, óf die Outomatiseringsnetwerk-waarde leeg gelaat word, sal Cacti die stelsel se verstek Van-naam gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php:588
msgid "Automation Notification From Email"
msgstr "Outomatiseringskennisgewing vanaf e-pos"

#: include/global_settings.php:589
msgid "The Email Address to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Email Address."
msgstr "Die E-posadres om vir Outomatisering-kennisgewing-e-posse te gebruik as dit nie op die Outomatiseringsnetwerk-vlak gespesifiseer is nie.  As óf hierdie veld, óf die Outomatiseringsnetwerk-waarde leeg gelaat word, sal Cacti die stelsel se verstek Van-e-posadres gebruik."

