#: include/global_settings.php:1459
msgid "The maximum amount of time a Cacti's Maintenance script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Die maksimum hoeveelheid tyd wat 'n Cacti-onderhoudskrip kan loop sonder om 'n tydlimietfout te genereer en gestop te word."

#: include/global_settings.php:1472
msgid "Spikekill Background Generation Timeout"
msgstr "SpikeKill-agtergrondgenerering-tydlimiet"

#: include/global_settings.php:1473
msgid "The maximum amount of time a Cacti's Spikekill script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Die maksimum hoeveelheid tyd wat 'n Cacti Spikekill-skrip kan loop sonder om 'n tydlimietfout te genereer en gestop te word."

#: include/global_settings.php:1489
msgid "Data Collector Defaults"
msgstr "Dataversamelaar-verstekwaardes"

#: include/global_settings.php:1490
msgid "These settings are maintained at the Data Collector level.  The values here are only defaults used when first creating a Data Collector."
msgstr "Hierdie instellings word op die Dataversamelaar-vlak onderhou.  Die waardes hier is slegs verstekwaardes wat gebruik word wanneer 'n Dataversamelaar die eerste keer geskep word."

#: include/global_settings.php:1495
msgid "Data Collector Processes"
msgstr "Dataversamelaar-prosesse"

#: include/global_settings.php:1496
msgid "The default number of concurrent processes to execute per Data Collector.  NOTE: Starting from Cacti 1.2, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector.  Moving forward, this value is only a preset for the Data Collector.  Using a higher number when using cmd.php will improve performance.  Performance improvements in Spine are best resolved with the threads parameter.  When using Spine, we recommend a lower number and leveraging threads instead.  When using cmd.php, use no more than 2x the number of CPU cores."
msgstr "Die verstek aantal gelyktydige prosesse om per Dataversamelaar uit te voer.  LET WEL: Vanaf Cacti 1.2 word hierdie instelling in die Dataversamelaar onderhou.  Voortaan is hierdie waarde slegs 'n voorafinstelling vir die Dataversamelaar.  Om 'n hoër getal te gebruik wanneer cmd.php gebruik word, sal werkverrigting verbeter.  Werkverrigting-verbeterings in Spine word die beste met die drade-parameter opgelos.  Wanneer Spine gebruik word, beveel ons 'n laer getal aan en om eerder drade te benut.  Wanneer cmd.php gebruik word, gebruik nie meer as 2x die aantal SVE-kerns nie."

#: include/global_settings.php:1503
msgid "Threads per Process"
msgstr "Drade per proses"

#: include/global_settings.php:1504
msgid "The Default Threads allowed per process.  NOTE: Starting in Cacti 1.2+, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector, and this is simply the Preset.  Using a higher number when using Spine will improve performance.  However, ensure that you have enough MySQL/MariaDB connections to support the following equation: connections = data collectors * processes * (threads + script servers).  You must also ensure that you have enough spare connections for user login connections as well."
msgstr "Die Verstek Drade toegelaat per proses.  LET WEL: Vanaf Cacti 1.2+ word hierdie instelling in die Dataversamelaar onderhou, en hierdie is bloot die Voorafinstelling.  Om 'n hoër getal te gebruik wanneer Spine gebruik word, sal werkverrigting verbeter.  Maak egter seker dat jy genoeg MySQL/MariaDB-verbindings het om die volgende vergelyking te ondersteun: verbindings = dataversamelaars * prosesse * (drade + skripbedieners).  Jy moet ook seker maak dat jy genoeg ekstra verbindings het vir gebruikersaanmeldingsverbindings."

#: include/global_settings.php:1518
msgid "Authentication Method"
msgstr "Stawingsmetode"

#: include/global_settings.php:1519
msgid "<blockquote><i>Built-in Authentication</i> - Cacti handles user authentication, which allows you to create users and give them rights to different areas within Cacti.<br><br><i>Web Basic Authentication</i> - Authentication is handled by the web server. Users can be added or created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.<br><br><i>LDAP Authentication</i> - Allows for authentication against a LDAP server. Users will be created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.  If PHPs LDAP module is not enabled, LDAP Authentication will not appear as a selectable option.<br><br><i>Multiple LDAP/AD Domain Authentication</i> - Allows administrators to support multiple disparate groups from different LDAP/AD directories to access Cacti resources.  Just as LDAP Authentication, the PHP LDAP module is required to utilize this method.</blockquote>"
msgstr "<blockquote><i>Ingeboude stawing</i> - Cacti hanteer gebruikersstawing, wat jou toelaat om gebruikers te skep en vir hulle regte tot verskillende dele binne Cacti te gee.<br><br><i>Basiese webstawing</i> - Stawing word deur die webbediener hanteer. Gebruikers kan outomaties by die eerste aanmelding bygevoeg of geskep word as die sjabloongebruiker gedefinieer is, anders sal die gedefinieerde gastetoestemmings gebruik word.<br><br><i>LDAP-stawing</i> - Laat stawing teen 'n LDAP-bediener toe. Gebruikers sal outomaties by die eerste aanmelding geskep word as die sjabloongebruiker gedefinieer is, anders sal die gedefinieerde gastetoestemmings gebruik word. As PHP se LDAP-module nie geaktiveer is nie, sal LDAP-stawing nie as 'n kiesbare opsie verskyn nie.<br><br><i>Veelvuldige LDAP/AD-domeinstawing</i> - Laat administrateurs toe om veelvuldige uiteenlopende groepe vanaf verskillende LDAP/AD-gidse te ondersteun om toegang tot Cacti-hulpbronne te kry. Net soos LDAP-stawing word die PHP LDAP-module vereis om hierdie metode te gebruik.</blockquote>"

#: include/global_settings.php:1525
msgid "Support Authentication Cookies"
msgstr "Ondersteun verifikasiekoekies"

#: include/global_settings.php:1526
msgid "If a user authenticates and selects 'Keep me signed in', an authentication cookie will be created on the user's computer allowing that user to stay logged in.  The authentication cookie expires after 90 days of non-use."
msgstr "As 'n gebruiker staaf en 'Hou my aangemeld' kies, sal 'n stawingskoekie op die gebruiker se rekenaar geskep word wat daardie gebruiker toelaat om aangemeld te bly. Die stawingskoekie verval ná 90 dae van nie-gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php:1531
msgid "Special Users"
msgstr "Spesiale gebruikers"

#: include/global_settings.php:1536
msgid "Primary Admin"
msgstr "Primêre admin"

#: include/global_settings.php:1537
msgid "The name of the primary administrative account that will automatically receive Emails when the Cacti system experiences issues.  To receive these Emails, ensure that your mail settings are correct, and the administrative account has an Email address that is set."
msgstr "Die naam van die primêre administratiewe rekening wat outomaties E-posse sal ontvang wanneer die Cacti-stelsel probleme ondervind.  Om hierdie E-posse te ontvang, maak seker dat jou posinstellings korrek is en dat die administratiewe rekening 'n E-posadres het wat gestel is."

#: include/global_settings.php:1539 include/global_settings.php:1549
#: include/global_settings.php:1557 user_domains.php:433
msgid "No User"
msgstr "Geen gebruiker"

#: include/global_settings.php:1546
msgid "Guest User"
msgstr "Gasgebruiker"

#: include/global_settings.php:1547
msgid "The name of the guest user for viewing graphs; is 'No User' by default."
msgstr "Die naam van die gasgebruiker om grafieke te bekyk; is by verstek 'Geen gebruiker'."

#: include/global_settings.php:1554 user_domains.php:429
msgid "User Template"
msgstr "Gebruikersjabloon"

#: include/global_settings.php:1555
msgid "The name of the user that Cacti will use as a template for new Web Basic and LDAP users; is 'guest' by default.  This user account will be disabled from logging in upon being selected."
msgstr "Die naam van die gebruiker wat Cacti as 'n sjabloon vir nuwe Web Basic- en LDAP-gebruikers sal gebruik; is by verstek 'guest'.  Hierdie gebruikersrekening sal gedeaktiveer word om aan te meld sodra dit gekies is."

#: include/global_settings.php:1562
msgid "Basic Authentication Settings"
msgstr "Basiese stawingsinstellings"

#: include/global_settings.php:1567
msgid "Basic Auth Login Failure Message"
msgstr "Basiese stawing-aanmeldmislukkingsboodskap"

#: include/global_settings.php:1568
msgid "When using basic authentication, if there are issues mapping the username to a valid Cacti account, the message included here will be displayed to users.  It can include both text and HTML."
msgstr "Wanneer basiese verifikasie gebruik word, as daar probleme is om die gebruikersnaam aan 'n geldige Cacti-rekening te karteer, sal die boodskap hier ingesluit aan gebruikers vertoon word.  Dit kan beide teks en HTML insluit."

#: include/global_settings.php:1575
msgid "Basic Auth Mapfile"
msgstr "Basiese stawing-kaartlêer"

#: include/global_settings.php:1576
msgid "When using basic authentication, if the basic account needs to be translated to a different login account, you can specify a CSV file here to map the basic account to the desired login account."
msgstr "Wanneer basiese verifikasie gebruik word, as die basiese rekening na 'n ander aanmeldrekening vertaal moet word, kan jy hier 'n CSV-lêer spesifiseer om die basiese rekening aan die verlangde aanmeldrekening te karteer."

#: include/global_settings.php:1584
msgid "Local Account Complexity Requirements"
msgstr "Plaaslike rekening-kompleksiteitsvereistes"

#: include/global_settings.php:1589
msgid "Minimum Length"
msgstr "Minimum lengte"

#: include/global_settings.php:1590
msgid "This is minimal length of allowed passwords."
msgstr "Hierdie is die minimum lengte van toegelate wagwoorde."

#: include/global_settings.php:1597
msgid "Require Mix Case"
msgstr "Vereis gemengde kas"

#: include/global_settings.php:1598
msgid "This will require new passwords to contains both lower and upper-case characters."
msgstr "Hierdie sal vereis dat nuwe wagwoorde beide klein- en hoofletterkarakters bevat."

#: include/global_settings.php:1603
msgid "Require Number"
msgstr "Vereis syfer"

#: include/global_settings.php:1604
msgid "This will require new passwords to contain at least 1 numerical character."
msgstr "Hierdie sal vereis dat nuwe wagwoorde ten minste 1 syferkarakter bevat."

#: include/global_settings.php:1609
msgid "Require Special Character"
msgstr "Vereis spesiale karakter"

#: include/global_settings.php:1610
msgid "This will require new passwords to contain at least 1 special character."
msgstr "Hierdie sal vereis dat nuwe wagwoorde ten minste 1 spesiale karakter bevat."

#: include/global_settings.php:1615
msgid "Force Complexity Upon Old Passwords"
msgstr "Dwing kompleksiteit op ou wagwoorde af"

#: include/global_settings.php:1616
msgid "This will require all old passwords to also meet the new complexity requirements upon login.  If not met, it will force a password change."
msgstr "Hierdie sal vereis dat alle ou wagwoorde ook by aanmelding aan die nuwe kompleksiteitsvereistes voldoen.  As dit nie nagekom word nie, sal dit 'n wagwoordverandering afdwing."

#: include/global_settings.php:1621
msgid "Expire Inactive Accounts"
msgstr "Laat onaktiewe rekeninge verval"

#: include/global_settings.php:1622
msgid "This is maximum number of days before inactive accounts are disabled.  The Admin account is excluded from this policy."
msgstr "Hierdie is die maksimum aantal dae voordat onaktiewe rekeninge gedeaktiveer word.  Die Admin-rekening word van hierdie beleid uitgesluit."

#: include/global_settings.php:1635
msgid "Expire Password"
msgstr "Laat wagwoord verval"

#: include/global_settings.php:1636
msgid "This is maximum number of days before a password is set to expire."
msgstr "Hierdie is die maksimum aantal dae voordat 'n wagwoord gestel word om te verval."

#: include/global_settings.php:1648
msgid "Password History"
msgstr "Wagwoordgeskiedenis"

#: include/global_settings.php:1649
msgid "Remember this number of old passwords and disallow reusing them."
msgstr "Onthou hierdie aantal ou wagwoorde en verbied hergebruik daarvan."

#: include/global_settings.php:1654
msgid "1 Change"
msgstr "1 verandering"

#: include/global_settings.php:1655 include/global_settings.php:1656
#: include/global_settings.php:1657 include/global_settings.php:1658
#: include/global_settings.php:1659 include/global_settings.php:1660
#: include/global_settings.php:1661 include/global_settings.php:1662
#: include/global_settings.php:1663 include/global_settings.php:1664
#: include/global_settings.php:1665
#, php-format
msgid "%d Changes"
msgstr "%d veranderinge"

#: include/global_settings.php:1668
msgid "Account Locking"
msgstr "Rekeningvergrendeling"

#: include/global_settings.php:1673
msgid "Lock Accounts"
msgstr "Sluit rekeninge"

#: include/global_settings.php:1674
msgid "Lock an account after this many failed attempts in 1 hour."
msgstr "Sluit 'n rekening ná soveel mislukte pogings in 1 uur."

#: include/global_settings.php:1679
msgid "1 Attempt"
msgstr "1 poging"

#: include/global_settings.php:1680 include/global_settings.php:1681
#: include/global_settings.php:1682 include/global_settings.php:1683
#: include/global_settings.php:1684 include/global_settings.php:1723
#: include/global_settings.php:1724 include/global_settings.php:1725
#: include/global_settings.php:1726 include/global_settings.php:1734
#: include/global_settings.php:1735 include/global_settings.php:1736
#: include/global_settings.php:1737
#, php-format
msgid "%d Attempts"
msgstr "%d pogings"

#: include/global_settings.php:1687
msgid "Auto Unlock"
msgstr "Outomatiese ontsluiting"

#: include/global_settings.php:1688
msgid "An account will automatically be unlocked after this many minutes.  Even if the correct password is entered, the account will not unlock until this time limit has been met.  Max of 1440 minutes (1 Day)"
msgstr "'n Rekening sal outomaties ná hierdie aantal minute ontsluit word. Selfs al word die korrekte wagwoord ingevoer, sal die rekening nie ontsluit voordat hierdie tydlimiet bereik is nie. Maksimum van 1440 minute (1 dag)"

#: include/global_settings.php:1704 include/global_settings.php:2974
msgid "1 Day"
msgstr "1 dag"

#: include/global_settings.php:1707
msgid "Login Throttling"
msgstr "Aanmeldversmoring"

#: include/global_settings.php:1712
msgid "Throttle Logins"
msgstr "Versmoor aanmeldings"

#: include/global_settings.php:1713
msgid "Refuse Local, LDAP and Domains logins from a client address, or for a login name, after too many attempts within the time window below, even if the password is correct.  Unlike Lock Accounts, the account itself is never locked, and logins resume once the window passes.  Web Basic Authentication and remember-me logins are not throttled.  If config.php sets proxy_headers, also list the proxies in $trusted_proxies, or a client can choose the address it is counted under."
msgstr "Weier Plaaslike, LDAP- en Domeine-aanmeldings vanaf 'n kliëntadres, of vir 'n aanmeldnaam, ná te veel pogings binne die tydvenster hieronder, selfs al is die wagwoord korrek. Anders as by Sluit rekeninge, word die rekening self nooit gesluit nie, en aanmeldings word hervat sodra die venster verstryk. Web Basiese Verifikasie en onthou-my-aanmeldings word nie versmoor nie. Indien config.php proxy_headers stel, lys ook die instaanbedieners in $trusted_proxies, anders kan 'n kliënt die adres kies waaronder dit getel word."

#: include/global_settings.php:1718
msgid "Attempts per Login Name"
msgstr "Pogings per aanmeldnaam"

#: include/global_settings.php:1719
msgid "Refuse further logins for a login name after this many attempts within the time window, from any address.  A successful login clears the count."
msgstr "Weier verdere aanmeldings vir 'n aanmeldnaam ná soveel pogings binne die tydvenster, vanaf enige adres. 'n Suksesvolle aanmelding vee die telling uit."

#: include/global_settings.php:1729
msgid "Attempts per Client Address"
msgstr "Pogings per kliëntadres"

#: include/global_settings.php:1730
msgid "Refuse further logins from a client address after this many failed attempts within the time window, whatever login name is used.  IPv6 addresses are counted by /64 network."
msgstr "Weier verdere aanmeldings vanaf 'n kliëntadres ná soveel mislukte pogings binne die tydvenster, ongeag watter aanmeldnaam gebruik word. IPv6-adresse word per /64-netwerk getel."

#: include/global_settings.php:1740
msgid "Throttle Window"
msgstr "Versmoringsvenster"

#: include/global_settings.php:1741
msgid "The period over which login attempts are counted."
msgstr "Die tydperk waaroor aanmeldpogings getel word."

#: include/global_settings.php:1751
msgid "LDAP General Settings"
msgstr "Algemene LDAP-instellings"

#: include/global_settings.php:1755 user_domains.php:456
msgid "Server(s)"
msgstr "Bediener(s)"

#: include/global_settings.php:1756 user_domains.php:457
msgid "A space delimited list of DNS hostnames or IP address of for valid LDAP servers.  Cacti will attempt to use the LDAP servers from left to right to authenticate a user."
msgstr "'n Spasiegeskeide lys van DNS-gasheernames of IP-adresse vir geldige LDAP-bedieners. Cacti sal probeer om die LDAP-bedieners van links na regs te gebruik om 'n gebruiker te staaf."

#: include/global_settings.php:1762 user_domains.php:465
msgid "Port Standard"
msgstr "Poort Standaard"

#: include/global_settings.php:1763
msgid "TCP port for Non-SSL communications including LDAP + TLS.  Default is 389."
msgstr "TCP-poort vir Nie-SSL-kommunikasie insluitend LDAP + TLS.  Verstek is 389."

#: include/global_settings.php:1770 user_domains.php:474
msgid "Port SSL"
msgstr "Poort SSL"

#: include/global_settings.php:1771
msgid "TCP port for LDAPS for SSL communications.  Default is 636."
msgstr "TCP-poort vir LDAPS vir SSL-kommunikasie.  Verstek is 636."

#: include/global_settings.php:1778 user_domains.php:483
msgid "Protocol Version"
msgstr "Protokolweergawe"

#: include/global_settings.php:1779
msgid "Protocol Version to connect to the server with."
msgstr "Protokolweergawe om mee aan die bediener te koppel."

#: include/global_settings.php:1785
msgid "Connect Timeout"
msgstr "Verbindingsuitteltyd"

#: include/global_settings.php:1786
msgid "The Network Connect Timeout in seconds."
msgstr "Die Netwerkverbindings-tydlimiet in sekondes."

#: include/global_settings.php:1793
msgid "Bind Timeout"
msgstr "Bind-uitteltyd"

#: include/global_settings.php:1794
msgid "The Bind Timeout in seconds."
msgstr "Die Bind-tydlimiet in sekondes."

#: include/global_settings.php:1801
msgid "LDAP Debug Mode"
msgstr "LDAP-ontfoutingsmodus"

#: include/global_settings.php:1802
msgid "If Checked Cacti will log extra LDAP information to the Cacti log during Binding and Searching activities."
msgstr "Indien gemerk, sal Cacti ekstra LDAP-inligting na die Cacti-log aanteken tydens bind- en soekaktiwiteite."

#: include/global_settings.php:1807 user_domains.php:490
msgid "Encryption"
msgstr "Enkripsie"

#: include/global_settings.php:1808
msgid "Encryption that the server supports. NOTE: When using LDAP + TLS you must use version 3."
msgstr "Enkripsie wat die bediener ondersteun. NOTA: Wanneer LDAP + TLS gebruik word, moet jy weergawe 3 gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php:1814
msgid "TLS Certificate Requirements"
msgstr "TLS-sertifikaatvereistes"

#: include/global_settings.php:1815
msgid "Should LDAP verify TLS Certificates when received by the Client."
msgstr "Moet LDAP TLS-sertifikate verifieer wanneer dit deur die Kliënt ontvang word."

#: include/global_settings.php:1821 user_domains.php:497
msgid "Referrals"
msgstr "Verwysings"

#: include/global_settings.php:1822 user_domains.php:498
msgid "Enable or Disable LDAP referrals.  If disabled, it may increase the speed of searches."
msgstr "Aktiveer of deaktiveer LDAP-verwysings. Indien gedeaktiveer, kan dit die spoed van soektogte verhoog."

#: include/global_settings.php:1831 user_domains.php:504
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Modus"

#: include/global_settings.php:1832
msgid "Mode which cacti will attempt to authenticate against the LDAP server.<blockquote><i>No Searching</i> - No Distinguished Name (DN) searching occurs, just attempt to bind with the provided Distinguished Name (DN) format.<br><br><i>Anonymous Searching</i> - Attempts to search for username against LDAP directory via anonymous binding to locate the user's Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>Specific Searching</i> - Attempts search for username against LDAP directory via Specific Distinguished Name (DN) and Specific Password for binding to locate the user's Distinguished Name (DN)."
msgstr "Modus waarop cacti sal probeer om teen die LDAP-bediener te staaf.<blockquote><i>Geen soektog</i> - Geen onderskeide naam (DN)-soektog vind plaas nie, probeer net om met die verskafte onderskeide naam (DN)-formaat te bind.<br><br><i>Anonieme soektog</i> - Probeer om vir gebruikersnaam in LDAP-gids te soek via anonieme binding om die gebruiker se onderskeide naam (DN) op te spoor.<br><br><i>Spesifieke soektog</i> - Probeer om vir gebruikersnaam in LDAP-gids te soek via spesifieke onderskeide naam (DN) en spesifieke wagwoord vir binding om die gebruiker se onderskeide naam (DN) op te spoor."

#: include/global_settings.php:1838 user_domains.php:511
msgid "Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Onderskeidende naam (DN)"

#: include/global_settings.php:1839 user_domains.php:512
msgid "The \"Distinguished Name\" syntax, applicable for both OpenLDAP and Windows AD configurations, offers flexibility in defining user identity. For OpenLDAP, the format follows this structure: <i>\"uid=&lt;username&gt;,ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>. Windows AD provides an alternative syntax: <i>\"&lt;username&gt;@win2kdomain.local\"</i>, commonly known as \"userPrincipalName (UPN)\". In this context, \"&lt;username&gt;\" represents the specific username provided during the login prompt. This is particularly pertinent when operating in \"No Searching\" mode, or \"Require Group Membership\" enabled."
msgstr "Die \"Onderskeidende Naam\"-sintaksis, van toepassing op beide OpenLDAP- en Windows AD-konfigurasies, bied buigsaamheid in die definiëring van gebruikersidentiteit. Vir OpenLDAP volg die formaat hierdie struktuur: <i>\"uid=&lt;username&gt;,ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>. Windows AD bied 'n alternatiewe sintaksis: <i>\"&lt;username&gt;@win2kdomain.local\"</i>, algemeen bekend as \"userPrincipalName (UPN)\". In hierdie konteks verteenwoordig \"&lt;username&gt;\" die spesifieke gebruikersnaam wat tydens die aanmeldpor verskaf is. Dit is veral ter sake wanneer daar in \"Geen soektog\"-modus gewerk word, of met \"Vereis groeplidmaatskap\" geaktiveer."

#: include/global_settings.php:1845 user_domains.php:519
msgid "Require Group Membership"
msgstr "Vereis groeplidmaatskap"

#: include/global_settings.php:1846 user_domains.php:520
msgid "Require user to be member of group to authenticate. Group settings must be set for this to work, enabling without proper group settings will cause authentication failure."
msgstr "Vereis dat gebruiker 'n lid van groep is om te staaf. Groepinstellings moet gestel word sodat dit werk; aktivering sonder behoorlike groepinstellings sal stawingsmislukking veroorsaak."

#: include/global_settings.php:1851 user_domains.php:525
msgid "LDAP Group Settings"
msgstr "LDAP-groepinstellings"

#: include/global_settings.php:1855 user_domains.php:529
msgid "Group Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Groep onderskeide naam (DN)"

#: include/global_settings.php:1856 user_domains.php:530
msgid "Distinguished Name of the group that user must have membership."
msgstr "Distinguished Name van die groep waarvan gebruiker lidmaatskap moet hê."

#: include/global_settings.php:1862 user_domains.php:536
msgid "Group Member Attribute"
msgstr "Groeplid-attribuut"

#: include/global_settings.php:1863 user_domains.php:537
msgid "This refers to the specific attribute within the LDAP directory that holds the usernames of group members. It is crucial to ensure that the attribute value aligns with the configuration specified in the \"Distinguished Name\" or that the actual attribute value is searchable using the settings outlined in the \"Distinguished Name\"."
msgstr "Hierdie verwys na die spesifieke attribuut binne die LDAP-gids wat die gebruikersname van groeplede hou. Dit is noodsaaklik om te verseker dat die attribuutwaarde ooreenstem met die konfigurasie wat in die \"Onderskeidende Naam\" gespesifiseer is of dat die werklike attribuutwaarde deursoekbaar is met die instellings wat in die \"Onderskeidende Naam\" uiteengesit is."

#: include/global_settings.php:1869 user_domains.php:543
msgid "Group Member Type"
msgstr "Groeplidtipe"

#: include/global_settings.php:1870 user_domains.php:544
msgid "Defines if users use full Distinguished Name or just Username in the defined Group Member Attribute."
msgstr "Definieer of gebruikers die volle Distinguished Name of net gebruikernaam in die gedefinieerde Groeplid-attribuut gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php:1874
msgid "Distinguished Name"
msgstr "Onderskeidende naam"

#: include/global_settings.php:1879 user_domains.php:550
msgid "LDAP Specific Search Settings"
msgstr "LDAP-spesifieke soekinstellings"

#: include/global_settings.php:1883 user_domains.php:554
msgid "Search Base"
msgstr "Soekbasis"

#: include/global_settings.php:1884
msgid "Search base for searching the LDAP directory, such as <i>'dc=win2kdomain,dc=local'</i> or <i>'ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local'</i>."
msgstr "Soekbasis vir die deursoek van die LDAP-gids, soos <i>'dc=win2kdomain,dc=local'</i> of <i>'ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local'</i>."

#: include/global_settings.php:1889 user_domains.php:561
msgid "Search Filter"
msgstr "Soekfilter"

#: include/global_settings.php:1890
msgid "Search filter to use to locate the user in the LDAP directory, such as for windows: <i>'(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))'</i> or for OpenLDAP: <i>'(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))'</i>.  '&lt;username&gt' is replaced with the username that was supplied at the login prompt. "
msgstr "Soekfilter om die gebruiker in die LDAP-gids op te spoor, soos vir Windows: <i>'(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))'</i> of vir OpenLDAP: <i>'(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))'</i>.  '&lt;username&gt' word vervang met die gebruikersnaam wat by die aanmeldpor verskaf is. "

#: include/global_settings.php:1895 user_domains.php:568
msgid "Search Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Soek Onderskeidende Naam (DN)"

#: include/global_settings.php:1896 user_domains.php:569
msgid "Distinguished Name for Specific Searching binding to the LDAP directory."
msgstr "Distinguished Name vir spesifieke soekbinding aan die LDAP-gids."

#: include/global_settings.php:1901 user_domains.php:575
msgid "Search Password"
msgstr "Soekwagwoord"

#: include/global_settings.php:1902 user_domains.php:576
msgid "Password for Specific Searching binding to the LDAP directory."
msgstr "Wagwoord vir spesifieke soektog-binding aan die LDAP-gids."

#: include/global_settings.php:1907 user_domains.php:582
msgid "LDAP CN Settings"
msgstr "LDAP CN-instellings"

#: include/global_settings.php:1912 user_domains.php:587
msgid "Field that will replace the Full Name when creating a new user, taken from LDAP. (on windows: displayname) "
msgstr "Veld wat die volle naam uit LDAP sal vervang wanneer 'n nuwe gebruiker geskep word. (op Windows: displayname) "

#: include/global_settings.php:1917 package_import.php:538
msgid "Email"
msgstr "E-pos"

#: include/global_settings.php:1918
msgid "Field that will replace the Email taken from LDAP. (on windows: mail)"
msgstr "Veld wat die e-posadres uit LDAP sal vervang. (op Windows: mail)"

#: include/global_settings.php:1925
msgid "URL Linking"
msgstr "URL-skakeling"

#: include/global_settings.php:1930
msgid "Server Base URL"
msgstr "Bediener se basis-URL"

#: include/global_settings.php:1931
msgid "This is a the server location that will be used for links to the Cacti site. This should include the subdirectory if Cacti does not run from root folder."
msgstr "Hierdie is die bedienerligging wat vir skakels na die Cacti-werf gebruik sal word. Dit moet die subgids insluit as Cacti nie vanaf die wortelgids loop nie."

#: include/global_settings.php:1938
msgid "Emailing Options"
msgstr "E-posopsies"

#: include/global_settings.php:1942
msgid "Notify Primary Admin of Issues"
msgstr "Stel primêre admin in kennis van probleme"

#: include/global_settings.php:1943
msgid "In cases where the Cacti server is experiencing problems, should the Primary Administrator be notified by Email?  The Primary Administrator's Cacti user account is specified under the Authentication tab on Cacti's settings page. It defaults to the 'admin' account."
msgstr "In gevalle waar die Cacti-bediener probleme ondervind, moet die primêre administrateur per e-pos in kennis gestel word? Die primêre administrateur se Cacti-gebruikersrekening word onder die Stawing-oortjie op Cacti se instellingsbladsy gespesifiseer. Die verstek is die 'admin'-rekening."

#: include/global_settings.php:1948
msgid "Test Email"
msgstr "Toets e-pos"

#: include/global_settings.php:1949
msgid "This is a Email account used for sending a test message to ensure everything is working properly."
msgstr "Hierdie is 'n E-posrekening wat gebruik word om 'n toetsboodskap te stuur om te verseker dat alles behoorlik werk."

#: include/global_settings.php:1954
msgid "Mail Services"
msgstr "Posdienste"

#: include/global_settings.php:1955
msgid "Which mail service to use in order to send mail"
msgstr "Watter posdiens om te gebruik om pos te stuur"

#: include/global_settings.php:1961
msgid "Ping Mail Server"
msgstr "Ping posbediener"

#: include/global_settings.php:1962
msgid "Ping the Mail Server before sending test Email?"
msgstr "Ping die posbediener voordat toets-e-pos gestuur word?"

#: include/global_settings.php:1971 lib/html_reports.php:186
msgid "From Email Address"
msgstr "Vanaf e-posadres"

#: include/global_settings.php:1972
msgid "This is the Email address that the Email will appear from."
msgstr "Hierdie is die E-posadres waarvandaan die E-pos sal verskyn."

#: include/global_settings.php:1977 lib/html_reports.php:178
msgid "From Name"
msgstr "Vanaf naam"

#: include/global_settings.php:1978
msgid "This is the actual name that the Email will appear from."
msgstr "Hierdie is die werklike naam waarvandaan die E-pos sal verskyn."

#: include/global_settings.php:1983
msgid "Word Wrap"
msgstr "Woordomvou"

#: include/global_settings.php:1984
msgid "This is how many characters will be allowed before a line in the Email is automatically word wrapped. (0 = Disabled)"
msgstr "Hierdie is hoeveel karakters toegelaat sal word voordat 'n reël in die E-pos outomaties omgevou word. (0 = Gedeaktiveer)"

#: include/global_settings.php:1991
msgid "Sendmail Options"
msgstr "Sendmail-opsies"

#: include/global_settings.php:1996 lib/functions.php:6415
msgid "Sendmail Path"
msgstr "Sendmail-pad"

#: include/global_settings.php:1997
msgid "This is the path to sendmail on your server. (Only used if Sendmail is selected as the Mail Service)"
msgstr "Hierdie is die pad na sendmail op jou bediener. (Word slegs gebruik as Sendmail as die Posdiens gekies is)"

#: include/global_settings.php:2005
msgid "SMTP Options"
msgstr "SMTP-opsies"

#: include/global_settings.php:2010
msgid "SMTP Hostname"
msgstr "SMTP-gasheernaam"

#: include/global_settings.php:2011
msgid "This is the hostname/IP of the SMTP Server you will send the Email to. For failover, separate your hosts using a semi-colon."
msgstr "Hierdie is die gasheernaam/IP van die SMTP-bediener waarheen jy die E-pos sal stuur. Vir oorskakeling (failover), skei jou gashere met 'n kommapunt."

#: include/global_settings.php:2017
msgid "SMTP Port"
msgstr "SMTP-poort"

#: include/global_settings.php:2018
msgid "The port on the SMTP Server to use."
msgstr "Die poort op die SMTP-bediener om te gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php:2025
msgid "SMTP Username"
msgstr "SMTP-gebruikersnaam"

#: include/global_settings.php:2026
msgid "The username to authenticate with when sending via SMTP. (Leave blank if you do not require authentication.)"
msgstr "Die gebruikersnaam om mee te verifieer wanneer daar via SMTP gestuur word. (Laat leeg as jy nie verifikasie benodig nie.)"

#: include/global_settings.php:2031
msgid "SMTP Password"
msgstr "SMTP-wagwoord"

#: include/global_settings.php:2032
msgid "The password to authenticate with when sending via SMTP. (Leave blank if you do not require authentication.)"
msgstr "Die wagwoord om mee te verifieer wanneer daar via SMTP gestuur word. (Laat leeg as jy nie verifikasie benodig nie.)"

#: include/global_settings.php:2037
msgid "SMTP Security"
msgstr "SMTP-sekuriteit"

#: include/global_settings.php:2038
msgid "The encryption method to use for the Email."
msgstr "Die enkripsiemoetode om vir die E-pos te gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php:2042
msgid "SSL"
msgstr "SSL"

#: include/global_settings.php:2043
msgid "TLS"
msgstr "TLS"

#: include/global_settings.php:2048
msgid "SMTP Timeout"
msgstr "SMTP-tydverstreke"

#: include/global_settings.php:2049
msgid "Please enter the SMTP timeout in seconds."
msgstr "Voer asseblief die SMTP-tydverstreke in sekondes in."

#: include/global_settings.php:2056
msgid "Reporting Presets"
msgstr "Verslagdoening-voorinstellings"

#: include/global_settings.php:2061
msgid "Default Graph Image Format"
msgstr "Verstekgrafiekprentformaat"

#: include/global_settings.php:2062
msgid "When creating a new report, what image type should be used for the inline graphs."
msgstr "Wanneer 'n nuwe verslag geskep word, watter beeldtipe moet vir die inlyngrafieke gebruik word."

#: include/global_settings.php:2068
msgid "Maximum E-Mail Size"
msgstr "Maksimum e-posgrootte"

#: include/global_settings.php:2069
msgid "The maximum size of the E-Mail message including all attachments."
msgstr "Die maksimum grootte van die E-posboodskap insluitend alle aanhegsels."

#: include/global_settings.php:2075
msgid "Poller Logging Level for Cacti Reporting"
msgstr "Peiler-logvlak vir Cacti-verslagdoening"

#: include/global_settings.php:2076
msgid "What level of detail do you want sent to the log file. WARNING: Leaving in any other status than NONE or LOW can exhaust your disk space rapidly."
msgstr "Watter vlak van detail wil jy na die loglêer gestuur hê. WAARSKUWING: Om dit in enige ander status as GEEN of LAAG te laat, kan jou skyfspasie vinnig uitput."

#: include/global_settings.php:2082
msgid "Enable Lotus Notes (R) tweak"
msgstr "Aktiveer Lotus Notes (R)-aanpassing"

#: include/global_settings.php:2083
msgid "Enable code tweak for specific handling of Lotus Notes Mail Clients."
msgstr "Aktiveer kode-aanpassing vir spesifieke hantering van Lotus Notes-poskliënte."

#: include/global_settings.php:2088
msgid "DNS Options"
msgstr "DNS-opsies"

#: include/global_settings.php:2093
msgid "Primary DNS IP Address"
msgstr "Primêre DNS IP-adres"

#: include/global_settings.php:2094
msgid "Enter the primary DNS IP Address to utilize for reverse lookups."
msgstr "Voer die primêre DNS IP-adres in om vir omgekeerde opsoekings te gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php:2100
msgid "Secondary DNS IP Address"
msgstr "Sekondêre DNS IP-adres"

#: include/global_settings.php:2101
msgid "Enter the secondary DNS IP Address to utilize for reverse lookups."
msgstr "Voer die sekondêre DNS IP-adres in om vir omgekeerde opsoekings te gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php:2107
msgid "DNS Timeout"
msgstr "DNS-uitteltyd"

#: include/global_settings.php:2108
msgid "Please enter the DNS timeout in milliseconds.  Cacti uses a PHP based DNS resolver."
msgstr "Voer asseblief die DNS-tydverstreke in millisekondes in. Cacti gebruik 'n PHP-gebaseerde DNS-oplosser."

#: include/global_settings.php:2117
msgid "On-demand RRD Update Settings"
msgstr "Op-aanvraag RRD-bywerkingsinstellings"

#: include/global_settings.php:2122
msgid "Enable On-demand RRD Updating"
msgstr "Aktiveer op-aanvraag RRD-opdatering"

#: include/global_settings.php:2123
msgid "Should Boost enable on demand RRD updating in Cacti?  If you disable, this change will not take affect until after the next polling cycle.  When you have Remote Data Collectors, this settings is required to be on."
msgstr "Moet Boost op-aanvraag RRD-bywerking in Cacti aktiveer?  As jy dit deaktiveer, sal hierdie verandering eers ná die volgende peilingsiklus in werking tree.  Wanneer jy Afgeleë Dataversamelaars het, word vereis dat hierdie instelling aan is."

#: include/global_settings.php:2128
msgid "System Level RRD Updater"
msgstr "Stelselvlak-RRD-bywerker"

#: include/global_settings.php:2129
msgid "Before RRD On-demand Update Can be Cleared, a poller run must always pass"
msgstr "Voordat RRD-op-aanvraag-opdatering skoongemaak kan word, moet 'n poller-lopie altyd slaag"

#: include/global_settings.php:2134
msgid "How Often Should Boost Update All RRDs"
msgstr "Hoe gereeld moet Boost alle RRD's bywerk"

#: include/global_settings.php:2135
msgid "When you enable boost, your RRD files are only updated when they are requested by a user, or when this time period elapses."
msgstr "Wanneer jy boost aktiveer, word jou RRD-lêers slegs bygewerk wanneer dit deur 'n gebruiker aangevra word, of wanneer hierdie tydperk verstryk."

#: include/global_settings.php:2141
msgid "Number of Boost Processes"
msgstr "Aantal Boost-prosesse"

#: include/global_settings.php:2142
msgid "The number of concurrent boost processes to use to use to process all of the RRDs in the boost table."
msgstr "Die aantal gelyktydige boost-prosesse om te gebruik om al die RRDs in die boost-tabel te verwerk."

#: include/global_settings.php:2169
msgid "Maximum Records"
msgstr "Maksimum rekords"

#: include/global_settings.php:2170
msgid "If the boost output table exceeds this size, in records, an update will take place."
msgstr "As die boost-uitvoertabel hierdie grootte in rekords oorskry, sal 'n bywerking plaasvind."

#: include/global_settings.php:2177
msgid "Maximum Data Source Items Per Pass"
msgstr "Maksimum databronitems per deurgang"

#: include/global_settings.php:2178
msgid "To optimize performance, the boost RRD updater needs to know how many Data Source Items should be retrieved in one pass.  Please be careful not to set too high as graphing performance during major updates can be compromised.  If you encounter graphing or polling slowness during updates, lower this number.  The default value is 50000."
msgstr "Om werkverrigting te optimaliseer, moet die boost RRD-bywerker weet hoeveel Databron-items in een deurgang opgespoor moet word.  Wees asseblief versigtig om dit nie te hoog te stel nie, aangesien grafiekwerkverrigting tydens groot bywerkings benadeel kan word.  As jy grafiek- of peilingstraagheid tydens bywerkings ondervind, verlaag hierdie getal.  Die verstekwaarde is 50000."

#: include/global_settings.php:2184
msgid "Maximum Argument Length"
msgstr "Maksimum argumentlengte"

#: include/global_settings.php:2185
msgid "When boost sends update commands to RRDtool, it must not exceed the operating systems Maximum Argument Length.  This varies by operating system and kernel level.  For example: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ unlimited"
msgstr "Wanneer boost bywerkingsopdragte na RRDtool stuur, mag dit nie die bedryfstelsel se Maksimum Argumentlengte oorskry nie.  Dit wissel volgens bedryfstelsel en kernvlak.  Byvoorbeeld: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ onbeperk"

#: include/global_settings.php:2192
msgid "Memory Limit for Boost and Poller"
msgstr "Geheueperk vir Boost en peiler"

#: include/global_settings.php:2193
msgid "The maximum amount of memory for the Cacti Poller and Boosts Poller"
msgstr "Die maksimum hoeveelheid geheue vir die Cacti-poller en Boost-poller"

#: include/global_settings.php:2199
msgid "Maximum RRD Update Script Run Time"
msgstr "Maksimum RRD-bywerkingskrip-looptyd"

#: include/global_settings.php:2200
msgid "If the boost poller exceeds this runtime, a warning will be placed in the cacti log,"
msgstr "As die boost-peiler hierdie looptyd oorskry, sal 'n waarskuwing in die cacti-log geplaas word,"

#: include/global_settings.php:2206
msgid "Enable direct population of poller_output_boost table"
msgstr "Aktiveer direkte populasie van poller_output_boost-tabel"

#: include/global_settings.php:2207
msgid "Enables direct insert of records into poller output boost with results in a 25% time reduction in each poll cycle."
msgstr "Aktiveer direkte invoeging van rekords in poller output boost, wat 'n 25% tydsvermindering in elke peilingsiklus tot gevolg het."

#: include/global_settings.php:2212
msgid "Boost Debug Log"
msgstr "Boost-ontfoutingslogboek"

#: include/global_settings.php:2213
msgid "If this field is non-blank, Boost will log RRDUpdate output from the boost\tpoller process."
msgstr "As hierdie veld nie leeg is nie, sal Boost RRDUpdate-uitvoer vanaf die boost\tpeilerproses aanteken."

#: include/global_settings.php:2220 utilities.php:2979
msgid "Image Caching"
msgstr "Beeldkasgeheue"

#: include/global_settings.php:2225
msgid "Enable Image Caching"
msgstr "Aktiveer prentkas"

#: include/global_settings.php:2226
msgid "Should image caching be enabled?"
msgstr "Moet beeldkas geaktiveer word?"

#: include/global_settings.php:2231
msgid "Location for Image Files"
msgstr "Ligging vir beeldlêers"

#: include/global_settings.php:2232
msgid "Specify the location where Boost should place your image files.  These files will be automatically purged by the poller when they expire."
msgstr "Spesifiseer die ligging waar Boost jou beeldlêers moet plaas.  Hierdie lêers sal outomaties deur die poller skoongemaak word wanneer hulle verval."

#: include/global_settings.php:2240
msgid "Data Sources Statistics"
msgstr "Databronne-statistiek"

#: include/global_settings.php:2245
msgid "Enable Data Source Statistics Collection"
msgstr "Aktiveer databronstatistiek-versameling"

#: include/global_settings.php:2246
msgid "Should Data Source Statistics be collected for this Cacti system?"
msgstr "Moet Databronstatistieke vir hierdie Cacti-stelsel ingesamel word?"

#: include/global_settings.php:2251
msgid "Number of DSStats Processes"
msgstr "Aantal DSStats-prosesse"

#: include/global_settings.php:2252
msgid "The number of concurrent DSStats processes to use to use to process all of the Data Sources."
msgstr "Die aantal gelyktydige DSStats-prosesse om te gebruik om al die Databronne te verwerk."

#: include/global_settings.php:2279
msgid "Daily Update Frequency"
msgstr "Daaglikse opdateringsfrekwensie"

#: include/global_settings.php:2280
msgid "How frequent should Daily Stats be updated?"
msgstr "Hoe gereeld moet daaglikse statistieke bygewerk word?"

#: include/global_settings.php:2286
msgid "Hourly Average Window"
msgstr "Uurlikse gemiddelde venster"

#: include/global_settings.php:2287
msgid "The number of consecutive hours that represent the hourly average.  Keep in mind that a setting too high can result in very large memory tables"
msgstr "Die aantal opeenvolgende ure wat die uurlikse gemiddelde verteenwoordig.  Hou in gedagte dat 'n te hoë instelling tot baie groot geheuetabelle kan lei"

#: include/global_settings.php:2293
msgid "Maintenance Time"
msgstr "Onderhoudstyd"

#: include/global_settings.php:2294
msgid "What time of day should Weekly, Monthly, and Yearly Data be updated?  Format is HH:MM [am/pm]"
msgstr "Watter tyd van die dag moet Weeklikse, Maandelikse en Jaarlikse Data bygewerk word?  Formaat is HH:MM [am/pm]"

#: include/global_settings.php:2301
msgid "Memory Limit for Data Source Statistics Data Collector"
msgstr "Geheueperk vir databronstatistiek-dataversamelaar"

#: include/global_settings.php:2302
msgid "The maximum amount of memory for the Cacti Poller and Data Source Statistics Poller"
msgstr "Die maksimum hoeveelheid geheue vir die Cacti-poller en Databronstatistiek-poller"

#: include/global_settings.php:2308
msgid "RRDfile Check"
msgstr "RRDfile-kontrole"

#: include/global_settings.php:2313
msgid "Enable RRDfile Check"
msgstr "Aktiveer RRD-lêerkontrole"

#: include/global_settings.php:2314
msgid "Should RRDfile check be enabled for this Cacti system?"
msgstr "Moet RRD-lêer-toets vir hierdie Cacti-stelsel geaktiveer word?"

#: include/global_settings.php:2319
msgid "Number of RRDfile Check Processes"
msgstr "Aantal RRDfile-kontroleprosesse"

#: include/global_settings.php:2320
msgid "The number of concurrent RRDfile check processes to use to use to process all of rrd files."
msgstr "Die aantal gelyktydige RRD-lêer-toetsprosesse om te gebruik om al die rrd-lêers te verwerk."

#: include/global_settings.php:2347
msgid "Check Frequency"
msgstr "Kontrolefrekwensie"

#: include/global_settings.php:2348
msgid "How frequent should RRD be checked ?"
msgstr "Hoe gereeld moet RRD gekontroleer word?"

#: include/global_settings.php:2354
msgid "Data Storage Settings"
msgstr "Datastoorinstellings"

#: include/global_settings.php:2360
msgid "Choose if RRDs will be stored locally or being handled by an external RRDtool proxy server."
msgstr "Kies of RRD's plaaslik gestoor sal word of deur 'n eksterne RRDtool-instaanbediener hanteer word."

#: include/global_settings.php:2365 include/global_settings.php:2405
msgid "RRDtool Proxy Server"
msgstr "RRDtool-instaanbediener"

#: include/global_settings.php:2369
msgid "Structure RRDfile Paths"
msgstr "Struktureer RRD-lêerpaaie"

#: include/global_settings.php:2374
msgid "Enable Structured Paths"
msgstr "Aktiveer gestruktureerde paaie"

#: include/global_settings.php:2375
msgid "Use a separate subfolder for each hosts RRD files.  The naming of the RRDfiles will be one of the following:<br><ul><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/host_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd.</li></ul><br>You can make this change after install by running the CLI script <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> after you make the change.  NOTE: If you change Max Directories value to decrease the number of directories, or if you change the Directory Pattern, empty directories will not be pruned after you rerun the <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> script."
msgstr "Gebruik 'n aparte subgids vir elke gasheer se RRD-lêers.  Die benaming van die RRD-lêers sal een van die volgende wees:<br><ul><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/host_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd.</li></ul><br>Jy kan hierdie verandering ná installasie maak deur die CLI-skrip <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> uit te voer nadat jy die verandering gemaak het.  LET WEL: As jy die Maks Gidse-waarde verander om die aantal gidse te verminder, of as jy die Gidspatroon verander, sal leë gidse nie gesnoei word nadat jy die <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b>-skrip weer uitgevoer het nie."

#: include/global_settings.php:2379
msgid "Directory Pattern"
msgstr "Gidspatroon"

#: include/global_settings.php:2380
msgid "Which Directory Pattern do you wish to use for Structured RRD Paths.  'Device ID' is the default.  The setting 'Device ID/Data Query ID' should be used when you have Devices with thousands of Graphs.  After Changing the Directory Pattern, you must run the Structured Path CLI script again to modify the RRDfile paths to the new Pattern."
msgstr "Watter Gidspatroon wil jy vir Gestruktureerde RRD-paaie gebruik.  'Toestel-ID' is die verstek.  Die instelling 'Toestel-ID/Datanavraag-ID' moet gebruik word wanneer jy Toestelle met duisende Grafieke het.  Nadat jy die Gidspatroon verander het, moet jy die Gestruktureerde Pad CLI-skrip weer uitvoer om die RRD-lêerpaaie na die nuwe Patroon te wysig."

#: include/global_settings.php:2384
msgid "Device ID"
msgstr "Toestel-ID"

#: include/global_settings.php:2385
msgid "Device ID/Data Query ID"
msgstr "Toestel-ID/Datanavraag-ID"

#: include/global_settings.php:2386
msgid "Device Hash/Device ID"
msgstr "Toestel-hash/Toestel-ID"

#: include/global_settings.php:2387
msgid "Device Hash/Device ID/Data Query ID"
msgstr "Toestel-hash/Toestel-ID/Datanavraag-ID"

#: include/global_settings.php:2391
msgid "Max Device Hash Directories"
msgstr "Maks toestel-hutsinggidse"

#: include/global_settings.php:2392
msgid "The maximum number of Device Directories to be created based upon hashed Device ID's."
msgstr "Die maksimum aantal Toestelgidse wat geskep word gebaseer op gehashte Toestel-ID's."

#: include/global_settings.php:2399
msgid "Restrict RRDfiles to the RRA Directory"
msgstr "Beperk RRD-lêers tot die RRA-gids"

#: include/global_settings.php:2400
msgid "When checked, Cacti refuses to save, create or update an RRDfile whose path resolves outside the RRA directory ($config['rra_path'] in include/config.php, &lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra by default), following symbolic links. A symbolic link inside the RRA directory that points elsewhere is refused as well. Leave this unchecked if any Data Source uses a custom path outside the RRA directory, or those Data Sources will stop updating."
msgstr "Wanneer dit gemerk is, weier Cacti om 'n RRD-lêer te stoor, te skep of by te werk waarvan die pad buite die RRA-gids oplos ($config['rra_path'] in include/config.php, by verstek &lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra), nadat simboliese skakels gevolg is. 'n Simboliese skakel binne die RRA-gids wat elders heen wys, word ook geweier. Laat dit ongemerk as enige databron 'n pasgemaakte pad buite die RRA-gids gebruik, anders sal daardie databronne ophou bywerk."

#: include/global_settings.php:2410 include/global_settings.php:2442
msgid "Proxy Server"
msgstr "Instaanbediener"

#: include/global_settings.php:2411
msgid "The DNS hostname or IP address of the RRDtool proxy server."
msgstr "Die DNS-gasheernaam of IP-adres van die RRDtool-instaanbediener."

#: include/global_settings.php:2416 include/global_settings.php:2448
msgid "Proxy Port Number"
msgstr "Instaanbediener-poortnommer"

#: include/global_settings.php:2417
msgid "TCP port for encrypted communication."
msgstr "TCP-poort vir geënkripteerde kommunikasie."

#: include/global_settings.php:2424 include/global_settings.php:2456
#: utilities.php:317
msgid "RSA Fingerprint"
msgstr "RSA-vingerafdruk"

#: include/global_settings.php:2425
msgid "The fingerprint of the current public RSA key the proxy is using. This is required to establish a trusted connection."
msgstr "Die vingerafdruk van die huidige publieke RSA-sleutel wat die instaanbediener gebruik. Dit word vereis om 'n vertroude verbinding te vestig."

#: include/global_settings.php:2432
msgid "RRDtool Proxy Server - Backup"
msgstr "RRDtool-instaanbediener - Rugsteun"

#: include/global_settings.php:2437
msgid "Load Balancing"
msgstr "Lasbalansering"

#: include/global_settings.php:2438
msgid "If both main and backup proxy are receivable this option allows to spread all requests against RRDtool."
msgstr "As beide die hoof- en rugsteuninstaanbediener bereikbaar is, laat hierdie opsie toe om alle versoeke na RRDtool te versprei."

#: include/global_settings.php:2443
msgid "The DNS hostname or IP address of the RRDtool backup proxy server if proxy is running in MSR mode."
msgstr "Die DNS-gasheernaam of IP-adres van die RRDtool-rugsteuninstaanbediener as die instaanbediener in MSR-modus loop."

#: include/global_settings.php:2449
msgid "TCP port for encrypted communication with the backup proxy."
msgstr "TCP-poort vir geënkripteerde kommunikasie met die rugsteuninstaanbediener."

#: include/global_settings.php:2457
msgid "The fingerprint of the current public RSA key the backup proxy is using. This required to establish a trusted connection."
msgstr "Die vingerafdruk van die huidige publieke RSA-sleutel wat die rugsteuninstaanbediener gebruik. Dit word vereis om 'n vertroude verbinding te vestig."

#: include/global_settings.php:2466
msgid "Spike Kill Settings"
msgstr "SpikeKill-instellings"

#: include/global_settings.php:2471
msgid "Removal Method"
msgstr "Verwyderingsmetode"

#: include/global_settings.php:2472
msgid "There are two removal methods.  The first, Standard Deviation, will remove any sample that is X number of standard deviations away from the average of samples.  The second method, Variance, will remove any sample that is X% more than the Variance average.  The Variance method takes into account a certain number of 'outliers'.  Those are exceptional samples, like the spike, that need to be excluded from the Variance Average calculation."
msgstr "Daar is twee verwyderingsmetodes.  Die eerste, Standaardafwyking, sal enige monster verwyder wat X aantal standaardafwykings weg van die gemiddelde van monsters is.  Die tweede metode, Variansie, sal enige monster verwyder wat X% meer as die Variansie-gemiddelde is.  Die Variansie-metode neem 'n sekere aantal 'uitskieters' in ag.  Dit is uitsonderlike monsters, soos die piek, wat uit die Variansie-gemiddelde-berekening uitgesluit moet word."

#: include/global_settings.php:2476
msgid "Standard Deviation"
msgstr "Standaardafwyking"

#: include/global_settings.php:2477
msgid "Variance Based w/Outliers Removed"
msgstr "Variansie-gebaseer met Uitskieters verwyder"

#: include/global_settings.php:2481 lib/html.php:2669
msgid "Replacement Method"
msgstr "Vervangingsmetode"

#: include/global_settings.php:2482
msgid "There are three replacement methods.  The first method replaces the spike with the average of the data source in question.  The second method replaces the spike with a 'NaN'.  The last replaces the spike with the last known good value found."
msgstr "Daar is drie vervangingsmetodes.  Die eerste metode vervang die piek met die gemiddelde van die betrokke databron.  Die tweede metode vervang die piek met 'n 'NaN'.  Die laaste vervang die piek met die laaste bekende goeie waarde wat gevind is."

#: include/global_settings.php:2486 lib/html.php:2665
msgid "Average"
msgstr "Gemiddeld"

#: include/global_settings.php:2487 lib/html.php:2666
msgid "NaN's"
msgstr "NaN's"

#: include/global_settings.php:2488 lib/html.php:2667
msgid "Last Known Good"
msgstr "Laaste bekende goeie"

#: include/global_settings.php:2492
msgid "Number of Standard Deviations"
msgstr "Aantal standaardafwykings"

#: include/global_settings.php:2493
msgid "Any value that is this many standard deviations above the average will be excluded.  A good number will be dependent on the type of data to be operated on.  We recommend a number no lower than 5 Standard Deviations."
msgstr "Enige waarde wat soveel standaardafwykings bo die gemiddeld is, sal uitgesluit word. 'n Goeie getal hang af van die tipe data waarop gewerk word. Ons beveel 'n getal nie laer as 5 standaardafwykings aan nie."

