#: index.php:89
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> You are logged into a Remote Data Collector.  When <b>'online'</b>, you will be able to view and control much of the Main Cacti Web Site just as if you were logged into it.  Also, it's important to note that Remote Data Collectors are required to use the Cacti's Performance Boosting Services <b>'On Demand Updating'</b> feature, and we always recommend using Spine.  When the Remote Data Collector is <b>'offline'</b>, the Remote Data Collectors Web Site will contain much less information.  However, it will cache all updates until the Main Cacti Database and Web Server are reachable.  Then it will dump it's Boost table output back to the Main Cacti Database for updating."
msgstr "<strong>NOTA:</strong> Jy is aangemeld by 'n afstanddataversamelaar. Wanneer jy <b>'aanlyn'</b> is, sal jy baie van die hoof-Cacti-webwerf kan bekyk en beheer net asof jy daarby aangemeld was. Dit is ook belangrik om daarop te let dat afstanddataversamelaars vereis word om Cacti se werkverrigtingversnellingsdiens se <b>'Op aanvraag-opdatering'</b>-funksie te gebruik, en ons beveel altyd aan om Spine te gebruik. Wanneer die afstanddataversamelaar <b>'aflyn'</b> is, sal die afstanddataversamelaar se webwerf baie minder inligting bevat. Dit sal egter alle opdaterings kas totdat die hoof-Cacti-databasis en -webbediener bereikbaar is. Daarna sal dit sy Boost-tabelafvoer terugstort na die hoof-Cacti-databasis vir opdatering."

#: index.php:94
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> None of the Core Cacti Plugins, to date, have been re-designed to work with Remote Data Collectors.  Therefore, Plugins such as MacTrack, and HMIB, which require direct access to devices will not work with Remote Data Collectors at this time.  However, plugins such as Thold will work so long as the Remote Data Collector is in <b>'online'</b> mode."
msgstr "<strong>NOTA:</strong> Geen van die kern-Cacti-inproppe is tot dusver herontwerp om met afstanddataversamelaars te werk nie. Daarom sal inproppe soos MacTrack en HMIB, wat direkte toegang tot toestelle vereis, tans nie met afstanddataversamelaars werk nie. Inproppe soos Thold sal egter werk solank die afstanddataversamelaar in <b>'aanlyn'</b>-modus is."

