#: utilities.php:2355
msgid "The Cacti Log stores statistic, error and other message depending on system settings.  This information can be used to identify problems with the poller and application."
msgstr "Die Cacti-log stoor statistieke, foute en ander boodskappe afhangende van stelselinstellings.  Hierdie inligting kan gebruik word om probleme met die poller en toepassing te identifiseer."

#: utilities.php:2359
msgid "Allows Administrators to browse the user log.  Administrators can filter and export the log as well."
msgstr "Laat administrateurs toe om deur die gebruikerslogboek te blaai. Administrateurs kan die logboek ook filtreer en uitvoer."

#: utilities.php:2363
msgid "Poller Cache Administration"
msgstr "Peilerkasgeheue-administrasie"

#: utilities.php:2366
msgid "This is the data that is being passed to the poller each time it runs. This data is then in turn executed/interpreted and the results are fed into the RRDfiles for graphing or the database for display."
msgstr "Hierdie is die data wat elke keer wanneer die poller loop, daaraan deurgegee word. Hierdie data word dan op sy beurt uitgevoer/geïnterpreteer en die resultate word in die RRD-lêers gevoer vir grafieke of in die databasis vir vertoon."

#: utilities.php:2370
msgid "The Data Query Cache stores information gathered from Data Query input types. The values from these fields can be used in the text area of Graphs for Legends, Vertical Labels, and GPRINTS as well as in CDEF's."
msgstr "Die Datanavraag-kas stoor inligting wat uit Datanavraag-invoertipes ingesamel is. Die waardes uit hierdie velde kan in die teksarea van Grafieke vir Legendes, Vertikale Etikette en GPRINTS sowel as in CDEFs gebruik word."

#: utilities.php:2372
msgid "Rebuild Poller Cache"
msgstr "Herbou peilerkasgeheue"

#: utilities.php:2376
msgid "The Poller Cache will be re-generated if you select this option. Use this option only in the event of a database crash if you are experiencing issues after the crash and have already run the database repair tools.  Alternatively, if you are having problems with a specific Device, simply re-save that Device to rebuild its Poller Cache.  There is also a command line interface equivalent to this command that is recommended for large systems."
msgstr "Die Poller-kas sal hergenereer word as jy hierdie opsie kies. Gebruik hierdie opsie slegs in die geval van 'n databasisongeval as jy probleme ondervind ná die ongeluk en reeds die databasisherstelnutsgoed uitgevoer het.  Alternatiewelik, as jy probleme met 'n spesifieke Toestel ondervind, stoor daardie Toestel bloot weer om sy Poller-kas te herbou.  Daar is ook 'n opdraglynkoppelvlak-ekwivalent vir hierdie opdrag wat vir groot stelsels aanbeveel word."

#: utilities.php:2378
msgid "NOTE: On large systems, this command may take several minutes to hours to complete and therefore should not be run from the Cacti UI.  You can simply run 'php -q cli/rebuild_poller_cache.php --help' at the command line for more information."
msgstr "LET WEL: Op groot stelsels kan hierdie opdrag etlike minute tot ure neem om te voltooi en moet daarom nie vanuit die Cacti-gebruikerskoppelvlak geloop word nie. Jy kan eenvoudig 'php -q cli/rebuild_poller_cache.php --help' op die opdragreël laat loop vir meer inligting."

#: utilities.php:2382
msgid "Rebuild Resource Cache"
msgstr "Herbou hulpbronkasgeheue"

#: utilities.php:2386
msgid "When operating multiple Data Collectors in Cacti, Cacti will attempt to maintain state for key files on all Data Collectors.  This includes all core, non-install related website and plugin files.  When you force a Resource Cache rebuild, Cacti will clear the local Resource Cache, and then rebuild it at the next scheduled poller start.  This will trigger all Remote Data Collectors to recheck their website and plugin files for consistency."
msgstr "Wanneer verskeie Dataversamelaars in Cacti bedryf word, sal Cacti probeer om staat vir sleutellêers op alle Dataversamelaars te handhaaf.  Dit sluit alle kern-, nie-installasie-verwante webwerf- en inproplêers in.  Wanneer jy 'n Hulpbronkas-herbou afdwing, sal Cacti die plaaslike Hulpbronkas uitvee, en dit dan by die volgende geskeduleerde poller-begin herbou.  Dit sal alle Afgeleë Dataversamelaars sneller om hul webwerf- en inproplêers vir konsekwentheid na te gaan."

#: utilities.php:2390
msgid "Boost Utilities"
msgstr "Boost-nutsprogramme"

#: utilities.php:2391
msgid "View Boost Status"
msgstr "Bekyk Boost-status"

#: utilities.php:2393
msgid "This menu pick allows you to view various boost settings and statistics associated with the current running Boost configuration."
msgstr "Hierdie kieslyskeuse laat jou toe om verskeie boost-instellings en statistieke te bekyk wat geassosieer word met die huidige lopende Boost-konfigurasie."

#: utilities.php:2397
msgid "Data Source Statistics Utilities"
msgstr "Databronstatistiek-nutsprogramme"

#: utilities.php:2398
msgid "Purge Data Source Statistics"
msgstr "Suiwer databronstatistieke"

#: utilities.php:2402
msgid "This menu pick will purge all existing Data Source Statistics from the Database.  If Data Source Statistics is enabled, the Data Sources Statistics will start collection again on the next Data Collector pass."
msgstr "Hierdie kieslyskeuse sal alle bestaande Databronstatistieke uit die Databasis uitwis.  As Databronstatistieke geaktiveer is, sal Databronstatistieke weer met die volgende Dataversamelaar-deurgang begin insamel."

#: utilities.php:2407
msgid "RRD Utilities"
msgstr "RRD-nutsmiddels"

#: utilities.php:2408
msgid "RRDfile Cleaner"
msgstr "RRDfile-skoonmaker"

#: utilities.php:2411
msgid "When you delete Data Sources from Cacti, the corresponding RRDfiles are not removed automatically.  Use this utility to facilitate the removal of these old files."
msgstr "Wanneer jy Databronne uit Cacti skrap, word die ooreenstemmende RRD-lêers nie outomaties verwyder nie.  Gebruik hierdie hulpprogram om die verwydering van hierdie ou lêers te vergemaklik."

#: utilities.php:2416
msgid "Use this utility to display problems with missing rrd files or missing values in rrdfiles. You need enable rrdcheck in Configuration->Settings->Data"
